  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">需要安裝 OPTIFINE</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個資源包會更改光照級別，讓您的 Minecraft 角色即使在末地（The End）和下界（Nether）也能始終看得一清二楚！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">大多數</span></em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">伺服器允許使用 FullBright，因為它實際上並沒有提供太多優勢。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">FullBright 資源包在全球超過 2 億名 Minecraft 玩家中使用。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_iZEpKvaXD8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">您可以在 1.7 至 1.17 版本中使用此資源包！</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">重要提示！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">下載 <strong>1.6 - 1.12</strong> 版本的資源包時，請不要只下載第一個文件，而是下載額外的文件。這些文件可以無問題地使用，無需任何修改。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不包含夜視粒子效果。</span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如何下載和安裝 FullBright：</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iDicbnZaM08?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></em></span></p>",
